."><meta data-n-head="ssr" name="citation_reference" content="citation_title=Choi&amp;nbsp;GM, Jin&amp;nbsp;J, Shin&amp;nbsp;D, et al. Flexible hard coating: glass-like wear resistant, yet plastic-like compliant, transparent protective coating for foldable displays. Adv Mater 2017;29:1700205."><meta data-n-head="ssr" name="citation_reference" content="citation_title=Jeong&amp;nbsp;YC, Kim&amp;nbsp;DG, Kim&amp;nbsp;H. 66-1: invited paper: flexible yet robust cover window with enhanced bending stiffness. Symp Digest Tech Papers 2023;54:932-5."><meta data-n-head="ssr" name="citation_reference" content="citation_title=Jeong&amp;nbsp;SY, Shim&amp;nbsp;HR, Na&amp;nbsp;Y, et al. Foldable and washable textile-based OLEDs with a multi-functional near-room-temperature encapsulation layer for smart e-textiles. npj Flex Elect 2021;5:15."><meta data-n-head="ssr" name="citation_reference" content="citation_title=Jeong&amp;nbsp;EG, Kwon&amp;nbsp;JH, Kang&amp;nbsp;KS, Jeong&amp;nbsp;SY, Choi&amp;nbsp;KC. A review of highly reliable flexible encapsulation technologies towards rollable and foldable OLEDs. J Inform Display 2020;21:19-32."><meta data-n-head="ssr" name="citation_reference" content="citation_title=Ha&amp;nbsp;M, Choi&amp;nbsp;J, Park&amp;nbsp;B, Han&amp;nbsp;K. Highly flexible cover window using ultra-thin glass for foldable displays. J Mech Sci Technol 2021;35:661-8."><meta data-n-head="ssr" name="citation_reference" content="citation_title=Jo&amp;nbsp;W, Jeong&amp;nbsp;K, Park&amp;nbsp;Y, Lee&amp;nbsp;J, Gap&amp;nbsp;Im S, Kim&amp;nbsp;T. Thermally stable and soft pressure-sensitive adhesive for foldable electronics. Chem Eng J 2023;452:139050."><meta data-n-head="ssr" name="citation_reference" content="citation_title=Salmon&amp;nbsp;F, Everaerts&amp;nbsp;A, Campbell&amp;nbsp;C, Pennington&amp;nbsp;B, Erdogan-haug&amp;nbsp;B, Caldwell&amp;nbsp;G. 64-1: modeling the mechanical performance of a foldable display panel bonded by 3M optically clear adhesives. Symp Digest Tech Papers 2017;48:938-41."><meta data-n-head="ssr" name="citation_reference" content="citation_title=Han&amp;nbsp;SH, Shin&amp;nbsp;JH, Choi&amp;nbsp;SS. Analytical investigation of multi-layered rollable displays considering nonlinear elastic adhesive interfaces. Sci Rep 2023;13:5697."><meta data-n-head="ssr" name="citation_reference" content="citation_title=Kwon&amp;nbsp;Y, Lee&amp;nbsp;S, Kim&amp;nbsp;J, et al. Ultraviolet light blocking optically clear adhesives for foldable displays via highly efficient visible-light curing. Nat Commun 2024;15:2829."><meta data-n-head="ssr" name="citation_reference" content="citation_title=Back&amp;nbsp;JH, Kwon&amp;nbsp;Y, Cho&amp;nbsp;H, et al. Visible-light-curable acrylic resins toward UV-light-blocking adhesives for foldable displays. Adv Mater 2023;35:e2204776."><meta data-n-head="ssr" name="citation_reference" content="citation_title=Choi&amp;nbsp;JW, Lee&amp;nbsp;JH. Selectively UV-blocking and visibly transparent adhesive films embedded with TiO2/PMMA hybrid nanoparticles for displays. Materials 2020;13:5273."><meta data-n-head="ssr" name="citation_reference" content="citation_title=Wu&amp;nbsp;C, Zeng&amp;nbsp;S, Wang&amp;nbsp;Z, et al. Efficient mechanoluminescent elastomers for dual-responsive anticounterfeiting device and stretching/strain sensor with multimode sensibility. Adv Funct Mater 2018;28:1803168."><meta data-n-head="ssr" name="citation_reference" content="citation_title=Wang&amp;nbsp;J, Yao&amp;nbsp;K, Cui&amp;nbsp;K, et al. Contact electrification induced multicolor self-recoverable mechanoluminescent elastomer for wearable smart light-emitting devices. Adv Opt Mater 2023;11:2203112."><meta data-n-head="ssr" name="citation_reference" content="citation_title=Wang&amp;nbsp;C, Hu&amp;nbsp;H, Peng&amp;nbsp;D, Dong&amp;nbsp;L, Zhu&amp;nbsp;D. Soft devices empowered by mechanoluminescent materials. Soft Sci 2023;3:39."><meta data-n-head="ssr" name="citation_reference" content="citation_title=Li&amp;nbsp;L, Che